\pard\plain \s3\sb240\sa60\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\cgrid 
Detailed Description\par
\pard\plain 
{
\pard\plain \s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid {\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Provides supplemental - in addition to gcc's testsuite - gcc/gcov mc/dc tests to verify the full set of requirements accompanying this code. \par
}{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Contains Level A, B, and C coverage tests to supplement the tests already contained in the gcc open source mcdc testsuite, '{\field {\*\fldinst { HYPERLINK  \\l "AAAAAAAACC" }{}}{\fldrslt {\cs37\ul\cf2 gcc_testsuite_gcov-19.c}}}'. This program should be run with gcov to produce .gcov output files suitable for test analysis. \par
 Individual tests may or may not be called to demonstrate specific gcov coverage results. The tests are duplicated in many cases to show how calling them with different arguments changes the coverage results. The requirements and some tests are based on DOT/FAA/AR-06/54, 'Software Verification Tools Assessment Study'. \par
 \par
{{\s5\sb90\sa30\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\fs16\cgrid 
Author\par}\pard\plain \s81\li360\widctlpar\ql\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {\s17 \sa60 \sb30
Lorraine Prokop \par
}}{{\s5\sb90\sa30\keepn\widctlpar\adjustright \b\f1\fs16\cgrid 
Copyright\par}\pard\plain \s81\li360\widctlpar\ql\adjustright \fs20\cgrid {\s17 \sa60 \sb30
GNU Public License {
\par
\pard\plain \s41\li360\widctlpar\adjustright \shading1000\cbpat8 \f2\fs16\cgrid ** Usage      gcc -O0 -fprofile-arcs -ftest-coverage -fcondition-coverage -Wall\par
**            gcov -abcdfgH additional_gcc_testsuite.c \par
**               -o add_tests-additional_gcc_testsuite\par
**            * will generate 'additional_gcc_testsuite.c.gcov' file to be used\par
**              as input to 'gcc-mcdc-ver-tests-utassert_testrunner.c'\par
**            * need to also compile and perform .gcov coverage against \par
**              'gcc_testsuite_gcov-19.c", available as 'gov-19.c' from\par
**              [gcc.git] / gcc / testsuite / gcc.misc-tests / gcov-19.c\par
**            * see makefile 'makefile-add-tests' for additional details\par
** Limitations,Assumptions,Notes:\par
**            - Some tests intentionally remain uncalled to demonstrate\par
**              uncovered code paths\par
**            - Compiler optimization tests require specific flags (-O0 or -O3)\par
**              to reproduce expected coverage behavior\par
**            - Certain atomic relational and Boolean constructs do not produce\par
**              decision coverage in C, as noted within the tests\par
** File_History\par
**   MM/DD/YYYY  Author                DESCRIPTION\par
**  ----------  --------------------- ----------------------------------------\par
**   03/24/2026  Lorraine Prokop       Initial version & doc complete\par
**               lore.prokop@gmail.com\par
** }
 \par
}}}}
