\pard\plain \s41\li360\widctlpar\adjustright \shading1000\cbpat8 \f2\fs16\cgrid ** Global_reads_writes Reads: db->funcs and nested branch/condition\par
**         fields  Writes: none\par
** Limitations,Assumptions,Notes\par
**          - Caller must provide valid db and func_name pointers\par
**          - Name comparison is case-sensitive\par
**          - Returns -1 when the function, branch, or condition is not found\par
** Algorithm:\par
**   Locate the function by name\par
**   If not found:\par
**       Return -1\par
**   Validate that branch_id is within range\par
**   Search all branches for a matching block_id and branch_id pair\par
**   If no matching branch is found:\par
**       Return -1\par
**   Search the branch's conditions for a matching cond_id\par
**   If no matching condition is found:\par
**       Return -1\par
**   If Boolean_value is true:\par
**       Return 1 if true_missing is set, otherwise 0\par
**   Else:\par
**       Return 1 if false_missing is set, otherwise 0\par
** History\par
**   03/24/2026  Lore/Copilot  Initial code and documentation complete\par
**   10/20/2026  Lore Prokop   Per git issue #1, changed to Line Number Keying\par
**                             rather than block id keying\par
** }
 \par
